d shape consisting of four or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices, specified as "},{"code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instances, and the edges that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"connect them. For example, you could use a polygon shape to represent a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"building, a lake, or an area you want to highlight.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"}}}